Package: zoomriya-setup
Version: 13.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: ZOOMRIYA <os@zoomriya.com>
Depends: zoomriya-agent, zoomriya-id, sway, python3, python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, fonts-inter, iso-codes,
 fonts-noto-core, fonts-noto-cjk, adwaita-icon-theme, librsvg2-common, libpam-systemd, systemd, locales
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: ZOOMRIYA Box's first setup, on the box's own screen
 A full-screen app on the box's screen and keyboard (sway, locked to it), until the box is set
 up: the keyboard, the Ethernet connection, the time zone and the box's
 admin, made in ZOOMRIYA ID. Being in front of the box is what proves it's
 yours, so nothing of it goes over the network.
